    "oracle_text": "When Lord Xander enters, target opponent discards half the cards in their hand, rounded down.\nWhenever Lord Xander attacks, defending player mills half their library, rounded down.\nWhen Lord Xander dies, target opponent sacrifices half the nonland permanents they control of their choice, rounded down.",
